{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — practical habits, frameworks, and outcomes-focused coaching.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --glass-bg: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      --accent: #6dd3b6;
      --accent-2: #6b9cf0;
      --muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
      --glass-blur: 10px;
      --panel-radius: 14px;
      --max-width: 1080px;
      --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(12,18,28,0.45);
      color-scheme: light dark;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0; font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg,#0e1720 0%, #071022 60%);
      color: #eaf6f1;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg'); background-size:400px; background-repeat:repeat;
      padding:32px; box-sizing:border-box;
    }
    .wrap{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto;}
    /* NAV */
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#032425;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    nav a:hover{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.04),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));color:#fff}

    /* HERO */
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:22px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:28px}
    .panel{background:var(--glass-bg);backdrop-filter:blur(var(--glass-blur));border:1px solid var(--glass-border);border-radius:var(--panel-radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .lead{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#eef7f3}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    p.sub{margin:0;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.8)}
    .contact-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    label{font-size:12px;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.75);margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:#fff}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#032425;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:none;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.7);}

    /* PROOF GALLERY */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .proof-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .testimonial{flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#e6fbf6}
    .author{margin-top:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:8px;border-radius:10px;font-size:12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:default;position:relative}
    .badge svg{width:18px;height:18px;flex-shrink:0}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;bottom:calc(100% + 8px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#041018;color:#bfeee5;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .18s}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{opacity:1}

    /* PRICING COMPARATOR */
    .comparator{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:6px;border-radius:999px}
    .toggle button{background:transparent;border:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#032425}
    .price-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline}
    .price{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}
    .subtext{font-size:12px;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.65)}

    /* PROCESS / FAQ */
    .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .step{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .faq{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    details{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.01);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);}
    summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}

    footer{margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.6);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">WC</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.65)">Wellness coaching — outcome and habit-focused</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">Who I Help</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Pathways</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="panel">
          <p class="lead">Ready to adapt habits that sustain energy and focus across seasons of life?</p>
          <h1>Start the conversation</h1>
          <p class="sub">Share a few details and I’ll send a clear next step — a concise plan for a VIP Day or an intro pathway that maps into your week.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:14px" class="contact-form">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" type="text" placeholder="Full name">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@work.com">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
              <input id="phone" type="text" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="goal">What outcome are you pursuing?</label>
              <select id="goal">
                <option>Refine daily energy and focus</option>
                <option>Build a reliable morning routine</option>
                <option>Move from burnout to sustainable pace</option>
                <option>Design a VIP Day for immediate clarity</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <label for="message">A quick note (what matters most?)</label>
              <textarea id="message" placeholder="One or two sentences — key challenge and a realistic win."></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
              <button class="btn" id="submitBtn">Request a quick plan</button>
              <div class="meta">Prefer direct booking? <a href="book.html" style="color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none">Reserve a VIP day</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">By contacting you consent to receive replies to this address. No medical advice; coaching focused on outcomes, habits and frameworks.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="panel">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px">
              <div>
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.75)">Quick contact</div>
                <div style="font-weight:700">{{PHONE}} · <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
              </div>
              <div class="meta" style="text-align:right">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
            </div>

            <div class="comparator" aria-label="Pricing comparator">
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
                <div style="font-weight:700">Sample fee preview</div>
                <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose pricing view">
                  <button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Monthly</button>
                  <button id="packageBtn" role="tab" aria-selected="false">VIP Day</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end">
                <div>
                  <div class="price-row">
                    <div class="price" id="priceVal" data-monthly="320" data-package="1200">$320</div>
                    <div class="subtext">per month</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="subtext">Typical engagement: 3–6 months for measurable systems and habits</div>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align:right">
                  <div style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.75)">Tailored pricing for teams and extended packages.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px" class="proof">
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px">
                <div style="font-weight:700">Proof Gallery</div>
                <div style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.7)">Rotating testimonials · Credibility badges</div>
              </div>

              <div class="proof-row">
                <div class="testimonial" id="testimonialBox" aria-live="polite">
                  <div class="quote" id="quoteText">"I got a clear plan after one session and used it to shape a morning structure that actually sticks."</div>
                  <div class="author" id="quoteAuthor">— S. R., Product Lead</div>
                </div>
                <div style="width:86px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:flex-end">
                  <div class="badges" aria-hidden="false">
                    <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#bfeee5" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M8.5 12.5l2 2 5-5" stroke="#bfeee5" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                      Credibility
                      <div class="tooltip">Evidence-backed frameworks and client outcomes</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="12" rx="2" stroke="#bfeee5" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M7 11h10M7 15h6" stroke="#bfeee5" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
                      Published
                      <div class="tooltip">Featured guides and frameworks shared with peers</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
                <button id="prevTest" class="btn" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--accent);padding:8px 10px">Prev</button>
                <button id="nextTest" class="btn" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--accent);padding:8px 10px">Next</button>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">How I work</div>
            <div class="meta">A crisp process designed to create habits and frameworks without jargon</div>
          </div>
          <div><a href="programs.html" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">Explore pathways →</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="step">
            <div style="font-weight:700">1. Clarify</div>
            <div class="subtext">We map your current rhythm, commitments and friction points. Outcomes-focused questions, zero judgment.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div style="font-weight:700">2. Design</div>
            <div class="subtext">Actionable micro-habits and a simple framework you can try within a week.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div style="font-weight:700">3. Embed</div>
            <div class="subtext">Short cycles of feedback and adjustments so new practices stay in place.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div style="font-weight:700">4. Sustain</div>
            <div class="subtext">Transition to an ongoing rhythm or a VIP Day that resets momentum.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="panel" style="margin-bottom:16px">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Questions people ask</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:rgba(234,246,241,0.7)">Concise answers to common practical questions</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>Do you provide medical advice?</summary>
            <div class="subtext">No. Coaching provides systems, habits and accountability. For medical concerns please consult a licensed professional.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What is a VIP Day?</summary>
            <div class="subtext">A focused, half- or full-day collaboration to produce a concrete plan, routines, and a 30–60 day follow-up roadmap.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How long before I see change?</summary>
            <div class="subtext">Small shifts show within 1–2 weeks; durable pattern change is supported through 6–12 week cycles of practice and review.</div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
        <div style="flex:1" class="panel">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Ready to plan a VIP Day?</div>
          <div class="subtext">A single intensive session can map a clear path and practical next steps you can enact immediately.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn" href="book.html">Book a focus day</a></div>
        </div>
        <div style="width:320px" class="panel">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Prefer an email?</div>
          <div class="subtext">Send a short note and I’ll reply with a two-step plan and suggested next time slots.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Email {{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — pragmatic coaching for better systems and steady results · <a href="privacy.html" style="color:rgba(191,238,229,0.8)">Privacy</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Proof Gallery: rotates testimonials and supports prev/next
    (function(){
      const testimonials = [
        {text: '"I got a clear plan after one session and used it to shape a morning structure that actually sticks."', author: 'S. R., Product Lead'},
        {text: '"Two small habit shifts rebuilt my afternoon energy and saved hours each week."', author: 'M. T., Founder'},
        {text: '"The VIP Day created a concrete 60-day roadmap — no vague advice, just practical steps."', author: 'A. L., Consultant'},
        {text: '"Simple frameworks that fit a busy week. I make better choices without thinking about them all the time."', author: 'R. K., Manager'}
      ];
      let idx = 0;
      const quoteText = document.getElementById('quoteText');
      const quoteAuthor = document.getElementById('quoteAuthor');
      const nextBtn = document.getElementById('nextTest');
      const prevBtn = document.getElementById('prevTest');

      function show(i){
        idx = (i + testimonials.length) % testimonials.length;
        // fade animation
        quoteText.style.opacity = 0; quoteAuthor.style.opacity = 0;
        setTimeout(()=>{
          quoteText.innerText = testimonials[idx].text;
          quoteAuthor.innerText = '— ' + testimonials[idx].author;
          quoteText.style.opacity = 1; quoteAuthor.style.opacity = 1;
        },180);
      }

      nextBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=> show(idx+1));
      prevBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=> show(idx-1));

      // auto-rotate every 7s
      let auto = setInterval(()=> show(idx+1),7000);
      // pause on hover
      const box = document.getElementById('testimonialBox');
      box.addEventListener('mouseenter', ()=> clearInterval(auto));
      box.addEventListener('mouseleave', ()=> auto = setInterval(()=> show(idx+1),7000));

      // start
      show(0);
    })();

    // Pricing Comparator: monthly vs package with animated numbers
    (function(){
      const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');
      const packageBtn = document.getElementById('packageBtn');
      const priceVal = document.getElementById('priceVal');

      function animateValue(el, start, end, duration){
        const range = end - start;
        let startTime = null;
        function step(timestamp){
          if(!startTime) startTime = timestamp;
          const progress = Math.min((timestamp - startTime) / duration, 1);
          const value = Math.round(start + range * progress);
          el.innerText = '$' + value;
          if(progress < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }

      function setMonthly(){
        monthlyBtn.classList.add('active'); monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');
        packageBtn.classList.remove('active'); packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
        const current = parseInt(priceVal.innerText.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || parseInt(priceVal.dataset.package) || 0;
        const target = parseInt(priceVal.dataset.monthly);
        animateValue(priceVal, current, target, 560);
        document.querySelector('.subtext').innerText = 'per month';
      }

      function setPackage(){
        packageBtn.classList.add('active'); packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','true');
        monthlyBtn.classList.remove('active'); monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
        const current = parseInt(priceVal.innerText.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || parseInt(priceVal.dataset.monthly) || 0;
        const target = parseInt(priceVal.dataset.package);
        animateValue(priceVal, current, target, 560);
        document.querySelector('.subtext').innerText = 'one-time VIP Day fee';
      }

      monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click', setMonthly);
      packageBtn.addEventListener('click', setPackage);
    })();

    // Simple submit handler (local only)
    document.getElementById('submitBtn').addEventListener('click', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value || '—';
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value || '—';
      const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value || '—';
      // mimic a send
      this.innerText = 'Sent — check your inbox';
      this.disabled = true;
      setTimeout(()=>{ this.innerText = 'Request a quick plan'; this.disabled = false; }, 3500);
      console.log('Contact request', {name,email,goal});
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page (chunk 4)

This bundle contains two files for the wellness coach website — focused on the contact page and documentation.

Files included:
- contact.html — Full contact page, styled with a glass-morphism look, contains local JS for interactive micro-features.
- README.md — This file (usage notes and customization guidance).

Placeholders to replace (must remain in templates until replaced at build time):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

What the contact page includes:
- Navigation with a unique label set: Home, Who I Help, Offerings, Pathways, Investment, Stories, Book, Contact.
- A glass-morphism hero with a contact form (local-only; no backend wiring).
- Proof Gallery: rotates testimonials (auto-rotate + prev/next) and shows credibility badges with tooltips. Implemented in-page with vanilla JS.
- Pricing Comparator: toggle between Monthly and VIP Day (package). Numbers animate between values; data attributes on the price element control values.
- Process overview and FAQ (practical, non-medical language). Includes clear note: coaching focuses on outcomes, habits, frameworks — no medical claims.

Key implementation notes:
- No external assets/fonts/CDNs. The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for background texture — include a unique SVG there in a different chunk.
- All interactions are local (no network requests). The contact form simulates a send and logs details to console.
- Accessibility: buttons use aria-selected where relevant; the testimonial area updates aria-live="polite".

Customization tips:
- Update placeholder values programmatically in your build/deployment script.
- To change pricing amounts, edit the data-monthly and data-package attributes on the #priceVal element.
- To change testimonials, modify the testimonials array inside the Proof Gallery IIFE in the script block.
- The pattern background can be swapped by replacing assets/img/pattern.svg.

Developer notes:
- The page follows the glass_morphism layout family and an executive_sharp voice — crisp, direct copy.
- Designed to be unique in structure, copy and nav labels compared to other templates.

If you need additional pages or assets from the project (icons, pattern SVG, or other HTML pages), request the next chunk specifying which files you need."}
